---
layout: layouts/shell.njk
title: false
description: Mitchtopia - the personal site of Mitch Gardner. Software, motorcycles, baking, and games.
---
{% from "components/panel.njk" import panel %}

<main class="landing">
  {# The wordmark is Breathe Fire III, converted to outlines.

     It is NOT loaded as a webfont: the licence is non-commercial and an
     @font-face rule would distribute the font binary to every visitor.
     Outlines ship no font file, and cost one small request instead.

     Drop the exported file at src/assets/img/mitchtopia.svg and it is used
     automatically; until then the styled text below stands in. #}
  <div class="title-card">
    {% set wordmark = "/assets/img/mitchtopia.svg" %}
    {% if wordmark | hasAsset %}
    <h1 class="title-card__name title-card__name--art">
      <img src="{{ wordmark | bust }}" alt="Mitchtopia" width="640" height="140">
    </h1>
    {% else %}
    <h1 class="title-card__name">Mitchtopia</h1>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="title-card__sub">Mitch Gardner</p>
  </div>

  {% call panel({
    id: "home",
    variant: "prompt",
    class: "is-intro",
    label: "Explore Mitchtopia",
    tabs: nav,
    currentUrl: page.url
  }) %}
    <p class="muted">
      Software engineer of ten years. Motorcycles, baking, and games in
      between. Explore my projects or learn more about me.
    </p>
  {% endcall %}
</main>
